//   `Update()` loses the argument, because 6.3's assignment runs on the
//   physics clock afterwards and puts the fall multiplier straight back.
//   Movement: the student chose a method in 2.2 (`linearVelocity` on the
//   Dynamic body, and no `Time.deltaTime`); the climb must use THAT, not
